; GreatSword (Cloud) — AttackLibrary.
; Kit philosophy: every attack has long sword reach. Slow startup = high reward.
;   Jab           : frame 3 — quickest option, puts the sword out fast.
;   ForwardTilt   : frame 9 — poke. Low angle keeps opponent close for follow-up.
;   UpTilt        : frame 7 — anti-air juggle. Big vertical range.
;   ForwardSmash  : frame 14 — big powerful horizontal slash, kills at 80%.
;   NeutralAir    : frame 4 — quick spin, good combo starter.
;   ForwardAir    : frame 8 — overhead slash, solid off-stage tool.
;   BackAir       : frame 6 — fast kill aerial, confirms from short-hops.
;   NeutralSpecial: frame 18 — Limit Slash, massive sword wave, kills at 60%.
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="AttackLibrary" load_steps=17 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/AttackLibrary.cs" id="Script_AttackLibrary"]
